Forró Box @VERSION@ — Linux x86_64
@UNDERLINE@

Contents
  ForroBox.vst3   the VST3 instrument (a folder — copy the whole folder)
  ForroBox        the standalone application
  LICENSE         GNU GPL v3 — source: https://github.com/dobidu/forrobox (tag @TAG@)
  NOTICE.md       third-party licences (JUCE, fonts, samples); font licences in licenses/

Requirements
  x86_64 with glibc 2.35 or newer — e.g. Ubuntu 22.04, Debian 12, Fedora 36, Linux Mint 21 or
  newer. The C++ runtime is built in. Runtime libraries: freetype, fontconfig, and ALSA
  (standalone only). Older distributions: build from source (see the README).

Install the VST3
  mkdir -p ~/.vst3 && cp -r ForroBox.vst3 ~/.vst3/
  (system-wide: /usr/lib/vst3/). Rescan plugins in your DAW (Reaper, Bitwig, Ardour...); it is listed as "Forro Box".

Standalone
  ./ForroBox
